{
  "page": "/run50/wechat/guilin-marathon-modern-rail.html",
  "title": "RunCN #第25站｜桂林马拉松",
  "ready": false,
  "images": 91,
  "slug": "guilin-marathon",
  "intro": "这是我跑中国的第二站，广西桂林马拉松。比赛从中心广场出发，赛道贴着漓江，一路跑进穿山和七星一带。前半程风景很好，后半程暴晒明显，爸妈和大娘也在终点等我。",
  "map": "/assets/cn-article-maps/china-light-37b794c22ee1f4c1.png",
  "poster": "../../assets/cover-medal-guilin.jpg?v=20260628-runcn-distinct-v1",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "title": "马拉松家庭聚会"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 6px 0 15px; padding: 8px 11px; line-height: 1.65; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.3px; color: #9f3a38; background: #f4f8fb; border-left: 3px solid #d4a669; font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', 'PingFang SC', serif; font-style: italic;\">马拉松家庭聚会</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 6px 0 15px; padding: 8px 11px; line-height: 1.65; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.3px; color: #9f3a38; background: #f4f8fb; border-left: 3px solid #d4a669; font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', 'PingFang SC', serif; font-style: italic;\">⛰️ 桂林，广西</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">在国内最后一周，本来想着还能多跑两天，结果这一个月一直在修牙，基本属于 “被迫休跑”。好在临走前好得差不多了，正好桂林马，<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"1\" style=\"color:#237953;font-weight:800;background:transparent;padding:0;border-bottom:3px solid #237953;padding-bottom:2px;\">可以来个火线复出</strong>。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-001.webp",
      "caption": "Guilin Marathon @Arsenan",
      "alt": "桂林马拉松照片 1"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">爸妈最近也在表妹的带领下在外面旅游，我们计划在桂林碰个头。这样我跑完，他们还能顺路跟我一起回佛山，再一起待个一周。<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"2\" style=\"color:#306eaa;font-weight:800;background:transparent;padding:0;border-bottom:3px solid #306eaa;padding-bottom:2px;\">之后我又要跨洋上班了</strong>，不知道下次啥时候回来了。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong data-cn-emphasis=\"color\" data-cn-tone=\"3\" style=\"color:#9a681c;font-weight:800;background:transparent;padding:0;\">所以这次桂林马</strong>，对我来说就有点 “一边复出、一边家庭小聚” 的味道，挺好。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-002.webp",
      "caption": "@Photographer",
      "alt": "桂林马拉松照片 2"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 6px 0 15px; padding: 8px 11px; line-height: 1.65; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.3px; color: #9f3a38; background: #f4f8fb; border-left: 3px solid #d4a669; font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', 'PingFang SC', serif; font-style: italic;\">马拉松博览会，两江四湖</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 6px 0 15px; padding: 8px 11px; line-height: 1.65; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.3px; color: #9f3a38; background: #f4f8fb; border-left: 3px solid #d4a669; font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', 'PingFang SC', serif; font-style: italic;\">⛰️ 桂林，广西</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">我比爸妈早一天到桂林。一下车就觉得这边挺热的，甚至比广东还热一些。把行李放到民宿后，<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"bold\" data-cn-tone=\"0\" style=\"color:#ac4336;font-weight:800;background:transparent;padding:0;\">我就直接去中心广场取装备</strong>。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-003.webp",
      "caption": "Airbnb @Arsenan",
      "alt": "桂林马拉松照片 3"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">桂林电动车特别多，过马路要注意一下，车来来往往，<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"1\" style=\"color:#237953;font-weight:800;background:transparent;padding:0;border-bottom:3px solid #237953;padding-bottom:2px;\">挺考验反应速度的</strong>。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-004.webp",
      "caption": "Guilin @Arsenan",
      "alt": "桂林马拉松照片 4"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">志愿者们穿着蓝色的衣服，看着都挺年轻，很热情。领装备的流程挺快，进去拿了号码簿和参赛包，<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"color\" data-cn-tone=\"2\" style=\"color:#306eaa;font-weight:800;background:transparent;padding:0;\">旁边还有摄影师给大家拍照</strong>。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-005.webp",
      "caption": "Expo @Arsenan",
      "alt": "桂林马拉松照片 5"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-006.webp",
      "caption": "Welcome to Guilin @Arsenan",
      "alt": "桂林马拉松照片 6"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-007.webp",
      "caption": "Volunteers @Arsenan",
      "alt": "桂林马拉松照片 7"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">天慢慢黑下来，展板上的“桂马欢迎您”还亮着，<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"3\" style=\"color:#9a681c;font-weight:800;background:transparent;padding:0;border-bottom:3px solid #9a681c;padding-bottom:2px;\">很多跑友在合影</strong>，气氛挺浓。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-008.webp",
      "caption": "Welcome to @Arsenan",
      "alt": "桂林马拉松照片 8"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">吃了个粥垫下肚子，<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"0\" style=\"color:#ac4336;font-weight:800;background:transparent;padding:0;border-bottom:3px solid #ac4336;padding-bottom:2px;\">我就琢磨着去江边走走</strong>。这边还有 “跑桂马·游两江四湖” 的主题装饰，还有本地小姑娘穿着民族银饰和家里人在拍照。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-009.webp",
      "caption": "Sun and @Arsenan",
      "alt": "桂林马拉松照片 9"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-010.webp",
      "caption": "Sun and · 2 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "桂林马拉松照片 10"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">背景就是日月双塔，金色的是日塔，银色的是月塔，<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"color\" data-cn-tone=\"1\" style=\"color:#237953;font-weight:800;background:transparent;padding:0;\">两个塔在杉湖</strong>上，是两江四湖里最醒目的景点。江边也能租民族服装拍照，有不少人在直播，热闹得很。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">看时间还早，<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"bold\" data-cn-tone=\"2\" style=\"color:#306eaa;font-weight:800;background:transparent;padding:0;\">我就买了一张两江四湖的夜游票</strong>。船上有人讲解，船慢慢在湖面上打着灯，风景很漂亮。有些地方像东南亚的建筑，也有一些小桥、水榭、庭院的感觉。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-011.webp",
      "caption": "Sun Pagoda @Arsenan",
      "alt": "桂林马拉松照片 11"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-012.webp",
      "caption": "Guilin by Night @Arsenan",
      "alt": "桂林马拉松照片 12"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-013.webp",
      "caption": "Guilin by Night · 2 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "桂林马拉松照片 13"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">水上还有渔民在表演用鱼鹰捕鱼，虽然更像表演性质，不过<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"3\" style=\"color:#9a681c;font-weight:800;background:transparent;padding:0;border-bottom:3px solid #9a681c;padding-bottom:2px;\">第一次</strong>看到还挺有意思。楼台上还有舞蹈表演，灯光一打，挺好看的。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-014.webp",
      "caption": "Night Fishing @Arsenan",
      "alt": "桂林马拉松照片 14"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-015.webp",
      "caption": "When History @Arsenan",
      "alt": "桂林马拉松照片 15"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-016.webp",
      "caption": "Guilin by Night · 3 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "桂林马拉松照片 16"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">夜游途中要经过船闸。四湖和两江的水位不一样，所以要升一次再降一次。<span data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"0\" style=\"color:#ac4336;font-weight:800;background:transparent;padding:0;border-bottom:3px solid #ac4336;padding-bottom:2px;\">第一次</span>坐这种城市里的船闸，感觉挺新鲜。两江指的是漓江和桃花江，<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"color\" data-cn-tone=\"1\" style=\"color:#237953;font-weight:800;background:transparent;padding:0;\">四湖就是杉湖</strong>、榕湖、桂湖和木龙湖。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-017.webp",
      "caption": "Li River @Arsenan",
      "alt": "桂林马拉松照片 17"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">继续往前开，最有名的象鼻山突然出现在视线里。灯光照着山体，洞口也亮着，水面反光很漂亮。等到靠岸的时候已经快九点了。码头边还是很热闹，<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"bold\" data-cn-tone=\"2\" style=\"color:#306eaa;font-weight:800;background:transparent;padding:0;\">旁边正好在举办桂林米粉节</strong>，摊位很多。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-018.webp",
      "caption": "山路风景 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "桂林马拉松照片 18"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"3\" style=\"color:#9a681c;font-weight:800;background:transparent;padding:0;border-bottom:3px solid #9a681c;padding-bottom:2px;\">差不多十点的时候我才回到民宿</strong>。想着第二天早上去看个日出。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 6px 0 15px; padding: 8px 11px; line-height: 1.65; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.3px; color: #9f3a38; background: #f4f8fb; border-left: 3px solid #d4a669; font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', 'PingFang SC', serif; font-style: italic;\">穿山公园的日出，带父母游象鼻山</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 6px 0 15px; padding: 8px 11px; line-height: 1.65; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.3px; color: #9f3a38; background: #f4f8fb; border-left: 3px solid #d4a669; font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', 'PingFang SC', serif; font-style: italic;\">⛰️ 桂林，广西</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">周六这一天我起得挺早，四点多就醒了，<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"color\" data-cn-tone=\"0\" style=\"color:#ac4336;font-weight:800;background:transparent;padding:0;\">想着去穿山公园的穿山</strong>亭看看日出。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">这个地方是小红书上有人推荐的，说景色不错，虽然名气肯定比不上阳朔的相公山那种大热门日出点，但在桂林城区里已经算挺好的了。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-019.webp",
      "caption": "Sunrise in Guilin @Arsenan",
      "alt": "桂林马拉松照片 19"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">五点左右，天还是黑的，我到了穿山公园门口。找上山的路费了我不少劲，沿路也没什么灯，我就用手机当手电，顺着石阶往上爬。早晨爬山还是挺喘的，感觉比跑步还累。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-020.webp",
      "caption": "Sunrise in Guilin · 2 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "桂林马拉松照片 20"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">到了山腰的穿山亭，已经有不少人在卡位等日出。这里视野很开阔，可以看到桂林城区，还有远处一圈一圈的喀斯特山峰。桂林这种山叫峰林地貌，就是那种一座一座竖着冒出来的石灰岩山，看着很像水墨画里画的那种层叠山峦。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-021.webp",
      "caption": "Sunrise in Guilin · 3 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "桂林马拉松照片 21"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-022.webp",
      "caption": "Sunrise in Guilin · 4 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "桂林马拉松照片 22"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">天快亮的时候，山的颜色开始慢慢变，从深蓝到淡蓝，再到一点淡紫。太阳那天有点害羞，云比较厚，没能看到从山尖跳出来的那一刻。等它终于露脸时已经挂在了高一点的位置，不过光线打在山和城里那些小房子上，还挺好看的。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-023.webp",
      "caption": "Sunrise in Guilin · 5 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "桂林马拉松照片 23"
    },
    {
