      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-024.webp",
      "caption": "Sunrise in Guilin · 6 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "桂林马拉松照片 24"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-025.webp",
      "caption": "Sunrise in Guilin · 7 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "桂林马拉松照片 25"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-026.webp",
      "caption": "Sunrise @Arsenan",
      "alt": "桂林马拉松照片 26"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">天亮之后，山下那片密密麻麻的城区也清晰了起来。往右手边看，还有一片湖水，是桂林市区的溢江河道那一带，湖面反光金灿灿的。远处山顶上还能看到一座塔，那是穿山公园附近的 “塔山塔”，在当地算个老地标。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-027.webp",
      "caption": "Chuanshan Hill @Arsenan",
      "alt": "桂林马拉松照片 27"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-028.webp",
      "caption": "Chuanshan Hill · 2 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "桂林马拉松照片 28"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-029.webp",
      "caption": "Chuanshan Hill · 3 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "桂林马拉松照片 29"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">下山时我看到一处挺有名的“三友雕塑”：徐悲鸿、柳亚子、熊佛西。他们当年都在桂林生活过，也留下了不少作品和故事。走到跟前一看，三个人站在树荫下，感觉像穿越回了那个年代。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-030.webp",
      "caption": "Three Friends @Arsenan",
      "alt": "桂林马拉松照片 30"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">回民宿我补了个觉，中午我去机场接了爸妈和大娘。他们从成都飞过来。我们一起吃了点饺子，等太阳没那么毒了，傍晚就去象鼻山景区走了走。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-031.webp",
      "caption": "Dumpling @Arsenan",
      "alt": "桂林马拉松照片 31"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">象鼻山确实是桂林的招牌。之所以这么有名，就是因为那块山洞像大象把鼻子伸到江里喝水。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-032.webp",
      "caption": "Li River · 2 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "桂林马拉松照片 32"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-033.webp",
      "caption": "Wo @WoBa",
      "alt": "桂林马拉松照片 33"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-034.webp",
      "caption": "WoBa and WoMa @Arsenan",
      "alt": "桂林马拉松照片 34"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">它是在桂林漓江和桃花江交汇的地方形成的，历史上很多诗人画家都写过画过它，所以名气一直很大。景区现在也比较亲民，基本属于人人来桂林都会到此一游的那种。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-035.webp",
      "caption": "WoMan and DaNing @Arsenan",
      "alt": "桂林马拉松照片 35"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-036.webp",
      "caption": "WoMa and WoBa @Arsenan",
      "alt": "桂林马拉松照片 36"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-037.webp",
      "caption": "山路转弯 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "桂林马拉松照片 37"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">白天看象鼻山是一种感觉，晚上灯光亮起来又是另外一种。我爸说他小时候就听我爷爷提过象鼻山，说画册里有过它的图，所以这次算是终于见到真身了。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-038.webp",
      "caption": "山顶视野 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "桂林马拉松照片 38"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-039.webp",
      "caption": "Li River · 3 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "桂林马拉松照片 39"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-040.webp",
      "caption": "林间山路 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "桂林马拉松照片 40"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">逛完景区，天也快黑了，我们在附近吃了一家东北菜。味道挺正常，不过一看这分量和价格，也能感受到自己确实是在南方的旅游城市里吃饭。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-041.webp",
      "caption": "Dongbei Cuisine @Arsenan",
      "alt": "桂林马拉松照片 41"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 6px 0 15px; padding: 8px 11px; line-height: 1.65; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.3px; color: #9f3a38; background: #f4f8fb; border-left: 3px solid #d4a669; font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', 'PingFang SC', serif; font-style: italic;\">桂林马拉松，热力开跑</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 6px 0 15px; padding: 8px 11px; line-height: 1.65; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.3px; color: #9f3a38; background: #f4f8fb; border-left: 3px solid #d4a669; font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', 'PingFang SC', serif; font-style: italic;\">⛰️ 桂林，广西</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">终于到了比赛日。因为要八点才起跑，我快七点才从民宿出门。那时候爸妈还在阳台上给我挥手，让我加油，感觉挺温暖的。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-042.webp",
      "caption": "Airbnb · 2 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "桂林马拉松照片 42"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">起点在桂林中心广场，人非常多。我在 D 区，差不多绕了一公里。因为分区靠后，我八点二十才正式开跑。太阳一早就很有存在感，天气挺热的。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-043.webp",
      "caption": "Start @Arsenan",
      "alt": "桂林马拉松照片 43"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-044.webp",
      "caption": "Start · 2 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "桂林马拉松照片 44"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-045.webp",
      "caption": "Start · 3 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "桂林马拉松照片 45"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">刚开始三公里，跑到 “滨江路”。这段紧挨着漓江，风有点凉，景色也一下子“桂林味” 起来。远处那些喀斯特山峰顶在楼群后面冒出尖尖的轮廓，看着还挺特别。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-046.webp",
      "caption": "起点现场 · 赛事官方",
      "alt": "起点现场 · 赛事官方"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-047.webp",
      "caption": "Run with · 赛事官方",
      "alt": "Run with · 赛事官方"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-048.webp",
      "caption": "1KM @Arsenan",
      "alt": "桂林马拉松照片 48"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-049.webp",
      "caption": "@Photographer · 2",
      "alt": "桂林马拉松照片 49"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">摄影师也很多，我穿着红色阿森纳，混在一群黄色桂马参赛服里，确实挺像 “蛋炒西红柿里的那一撮红”。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-050.webp",
      "caption": "Run with · 2 · 赛事官方",
