    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-051.webp",
      "caption": "@Photographer · 3",
      "alt": "桂林马拉松照片 51"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-052.webp",
      "caption": "Run with · 3 · 赛事官方",
      "alt": "Run with · 3 · 赛事官方"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">从 “六公里到十二公里”，路线一路往北，穿过城市和山之间的区域。芦笛路靠近芦笛岩景区，算是桂林老牌名胜。桃花江路沿着桃花江跑，江面宽一点，两边是山和楼夹着，看着挺舒服。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-053.webp",
      "caption": "@Photographer · 4",
      "alt": "桂林马拉松照片 53"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-054.webp",
      "caption": "@Photographer · 5",
      "alt": "桂林马拉松照片 54"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">路边还有不少穿民族服饰的啦啦队，衣服颜色很亮，在那种大太阳底下也挺显眼。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-055.webp",
      "caption": "@Photographer · 6",
      "alt": "桂林马拉松照片 55"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-056.webp",
      "caption": "Ethnic Cheer Squad @Arsenan",
      "alt": "桂林马拉松照片 56"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-057.webp",
      "caption": "Water Station @Arsenan",
      "alt": "桂林马拉松照片 57"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">补给点志愿者穿蓝色衣服，远远看到就觉得凉快。我<span data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"1\" style=\"color:#237953;font-weight:800;background:transparent;padding:0;border-bottom:3px solid #237953;padding-bottom:2px;\">第一次</span>在补给点被摄影师抓拍，还挺有趣的。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-058.webp",
      "caption": "补给站 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "桂林马拉松照片 58"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">十公里左右经过 “桂林市图书馆”，这个建筑挺有特点，有点仿古的屋顶，照片里也挺上镜。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-059.webp",
      "caption": "@Photographer · 7",
      "alt": "桂林马拉松照片 59"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-060.webp",
      "caption": "Guilin Library · 赛事官方",
      "alt": "Guilin Library · 赛事官方"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">跑过 <span data-cn-emphasis=\"bold\" data-cn-tone=\"2\" style=\"color:#306eaa;font-weight:800;background:transparent;padding:0;\">13 公里</span>左右，就到了 “胜利桥”。胜利桥是桂林市区里一座比较显眼的老桥，桥身刷成橘黄色，也因为在这段地形上视野最好，所以经常能拍出跑者和山峰一起框在画面里的照片。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-061.webp",
      "caption": "Victory Bridge @Arsenan",
      "alt": "桂林马拉松照片 61"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-062.webp",
      "caption": "桥上风景 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "桂林马拉松照片 62"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">我们经过的时候太阳正顶着桥面照下来，颜色很亮，就是有点晃眼。过了胜利桥就跑到 “中隐路”，视野更开阔，不过这一段遮阴很少，基本全程暴晒，正式进入“阳光直射区”。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-063.webp",
      "caption": "20KM @Arsenan",
      "alt": "桂林马拉松照片 63"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">差不多二十公里，我停下来找了一个穿反光背心的大叔，让他帮我拍几张照，人特别好，还教我摆姿势。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-064.webp",
      "caption": "20KM @DaShu",
      "alt": "桂林马拉松照片 64"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">再往后就是城区的主要路段，后面路线会慢慢往穿山公园方向去，山会近一点，风景会再好些，阳光也……….</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 6px 0 15px; padding: 8px 11px; line-height: 1.65; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.3px; color: #9f3a38; background: #f4f8fb; border-left: 3px solid #d4a669; font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', 'PingFang SC', serif; font-style: italic;\">穿山走走跑跑，大喷水机也挡不住热浪</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 6px 0 15px; padding: 8px 11px; line-height: 1.65; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.3px; color: #9f3a38; background: #f4f8fb; border-left: 3px solid #d4a669; font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', 'PingFang SC', serif; font-style: italic;\">⛰️ 桂林，广西</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">半程过后没多久，路线就进入桂林很经典的 穿山、七星 一带。旁边就是穿山公园，七星公园也离得不远。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">这一段是很多跑友说的 “桂林马最好看” 的区间，路边都是那种典型的喀斯特山峰，几乎没什么遮挡，山直接立在你面前。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-065.webp",
      "caption": "Water Spray @Arsenan",
      "alt": "桂林马拉松照片 65"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-066.webp",
      "caption": "Tashan Hill @Arsenan",
      "alt": "桂林马拉松照片 66"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">跑着跑着，会看到一座塔在山上，很显眼。那是 穿山东塔，也是这段最容易被拍进跑马照片的地标。塔后面的山峦一层一层叠着，挺壮观的。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-067.webp",
      "caption": "Water Station · 2 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "桂林马拉松照片 67"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-068.webp",
      "caption": "26KM @Arsenan",
      "alt": "桂林马拉松照片 68"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">不过说实话，这时候我已经有点无心看风景了。手机快没电，耳机也没声音了，少了有声小说的陪伴，我这段跑得心态比较佛。主要还是天气太热了，太阳晒得有点恼火。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-069.webp",
      "caption": "Gy keres · 赛事官方",
      "alt": "Gy keres · 赛事官方"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">我就开始 “跑跑走走” 模式了，这场桂林马气温摆在这里，很多跑者其实都差不多。这段路是个大折返，折返点在 鲁山路 一带，也是全程公认的心理关口。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">没啥阴影，路宽又直，太阳就在正前方照着。一眼望不到头的直路，加上高温，确实容易让人心态松掉，我也带上了痛苦面具。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-070.webp",
      "caption": "Tower Photographer · 赛事官方",
      "alt": "Tower Photographer · 赛事官方"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-071.webp",
      "caption": "Hot @Photographer",
      "alt": "桂林马拉松照片 71"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">路边有很多喷水车，高压喷出来像小喷泉一样。刚穿进去确实凉快一点，但过三秒又热了。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">能明显感觉大家都在找各种方式降温，喝水、浇头、把海绵拍在脸上，什么都用上了。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-072.webp",
      "caption": "Little Spectators @Arsenan",
      "alt": "桂林马拉松照片 72"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-073.webp",
      "caption": "Fat Messi @Arsenan",
      "alt": "桂林马拉松照片 73"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 6px 0 15px; padding: 8px 11px; line-height: 1.65; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.3px; color: #9f3a38; background: #f4f8fb; border-left: 3px solid #d4a669; font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', 'PingFang SC', serif; font-style: italic;\">和胖梅西一起冲线，爸妈在终点等我</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 6px 0 15px; padding: 8px 11px; line-height: 1.65; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.3px; color: #9f3a38; background: #f4f8fb; border-left: 3px solid #d4a669; font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', 'PingFang SC', serif; font-style: italic;\">⛰️ 桂林，广西</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">折返以后再一次过漓江大桥，重新回到穿山路，城市的味道又回来了，路边开始热闹起来，观众也多了很多。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">这时候我看到前面有个穿迈阿密梅西十号的小辫子哥们，背影挺唬人的，我以为是外国人。追上去一看是中国的，我就跟他聊了两句。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-074.webp",
      "caption": "终点现场 · 赛事官方",
      "alt": "终点现场 · 赛事官方"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-075.webp",
      "caption": "终点现场 · 2 · 赛事官方",
      "alt": "终点现场 · 2 · 赛事官方"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">小辫是威海来的，我说我是东北的，他说难怪，说东北人来桂林肯定更受不了这太阳。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">聊着聊着他提议再跑一段，结果没一会就把我拉开老远。我寻思这不行啊，就稍微认真了一点，最后我们几乎以相同的步伐冲线。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-076.webp",
      "caption": "终点现场 · 3 · 赛事官方",
      "alt": "终点现场 · 3 · 赛事官方"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">摄影师还给我们拍了特写，我估计摄影师可能是梅西粉丝。我这身阿森纳球衣，在国内路上没几个人认得出来，就当蹭了梅西一把流量。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-077.webp",
      "caption": "Finish Line @Arsenan",
      "alt": "桂林马拉松照片 77"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">爸妈和大娘在终点站了好几个小时。我取了完赛包，桂林这块奖牌很有特色，金色的，还能转，拍照挺好看。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-078.webp",
      "caption": "WoMa#DaNiang @Arsenan",
      "alt": "桂林马拉松照片 78"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-079.webp",
      "caption": "WoBa @Arsenan",
      "alt": "桂林马拉松照片 79"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-080.webp",
      "caption": "Finish @Arsenan",
      "alt": "桂林马拉松照片 80"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-081.webp",
      "caption": "Medal @Arsenan",
      "alt": "桂林马拉松照片 81"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-082.webp",
      "caption": "Finish · 2 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "桂林马拉松照片 82"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">我绕着体育中心走出去，和爸妈汇合，我们一起拍了几张照片，留个纪念。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">回程的路上看见一长串被封路卡住的电动车。城市马拉松就是这样，有些人享受其中，有些人被困在其中，视角不同，很难达成共识。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-083.webp",
      "caption": "Finish @DaNiang",
      "alt": "桂林马拉松照片 83"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-084.webp",
      "caption": "Finish · 3 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "桂林马拉松照片 84"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-085.webp",
      "caption": "Finish @WoMa",
      "alt": "桂林马拉松照片 85"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">我们最后拦了个三轮车回旅馆，我点了外卖，和爸妈大娘一起吃了顿简简单单的外卖。桂林跑得不快，但照片比平时多好多，大太阳下还挺出片。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-086.webp",
      "caption": "Back to Airbnb @Arsenan",
      "alt": "桂林马拉松照片 86"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-087.webp",
      "caption": "Back to Airbnb · 2 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "桂林马拉松照片 87"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">休整一晚上我就准备回佛山了，这次桂林之行跑的挺慢，那又有啥呢？</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/RunCN-Guilin-Marathon-clean_files/img-088.webp",
      "caption": "Guilin Train @Arsenan",
      "alt": "桂林马拉松照片 88"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 6px 0 15px; padding: 8px 11px; line-height: 1.65; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.3px; color: #9f3a38; background: #f4f8fb; border-left: 3px solid #d4a669; font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', 'PingFang SC', serif; font-style: italic;\">从课本到赛道</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 6px 0 15px; padding: 8px 11px; line-height: 1.65; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.3px; color: #9f3a38; background: #f4f8fb; border-left: 3px solid #d4a669; font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', 'PingFang SC', serif; font-style: italic;\">⛰️ 桂林，广西</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">小时候课本里老写“桂林山水甲天下”，那时候只是记住了句口号。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">现在跑完这一圈，算是把这句话从文字变成了实际画面：山真就在眼前，河就在路旁，路线一段接一段，像把整座城市串成了一个长长的跑道。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">这次马拉松的路线，从城市跑到漓江边，又跑进喀斯特山峰的怀抱，穿过大桥、折返、再钻回穿山路。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">那些小时候只存在于照片里的山，今天变成了我跑步途中抬头就能看到的背景。山不动，我在动，像是把一段地理课本慢慢跑开了。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">更奇妙的是，我这一家东北人，全跑到中国最南边来给我加油，算是很神奇的经历。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.95; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; color: #26343f; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">再过一周我就要回美国了，就把这些文字和照片留下，当作一个小小的定格。</p>"
    }
  ]
}